{title: Akane mange}
{artist: ?}

{start_of_verse}
A[Am]kana mange [Dm]so kamav kai[E] sime bava[Am]lo
Asis man devla [Dm]nevi puv in[G]evo Jeruza[Am]lem
Akana bachta[Dm]le roma pa[E]čes amaro [Am]del
Asis man devla [Dm]kai devla kai[E] si amaro [Am]del
{end_of_verse}

